# Changelog MarkNote

## 1.1.0 - 07/10/2026

Mo rong giao dien tieng Anh va tai lieu.

- Giao dien chuyen sang tieng Anh, palette sang ep cung (het loi den/den,
  trang/trang tren OS toi); bo goc 2px, nut phang.
- Doi ten note inline: nut but ✎ / F2 (Enter/click ngoai de luu, Esc huy).
- Nut Tags hien ten tag cua note dang mo.
- Export Markdown (File > Export Markdown).
- Mục luc tu dong `[[TOC]]` / `[[TOC="Tieu de"]`, link nhan trong PDF.
- TOC kieu Word khi xuat PDF: gach cham + so trang that (target-counter,
  leader), chi trong @media print.
- PDF: so trang "x / y" o chan trang.
- Ngat trang khi in bang HTML page-break.
- Tai lieu: 5 file docs moi (HUONG_DAN_SU_DUNG, HUONG_DAN_CU_PHAP_MARKDOWN,
  DANH_SACH_TINH_NANG, VAN_DE_KY_THUAT, INDEX_BAO_CAO) + GFM_TEMPLATE.md.
- Xuat Markdown (.md) ra file tuy vi tri.
- README viet lai tieng Viet day du dau; HUONG_DAN_CAI_DAT chi tiet
  (Linux moi distro + Windows + macOS).
- Dong goi tinh: AppImage Linux x64 (PyInstaller, 1 file tu chua) + script
  build trong Docker distro cu (glibc menh hơn) + script build Windows
  (build_windows.ps1); Makefile them target appimage.
- Xu ly loi thieu thu vien Pango khi xuat PDF (thong bao cu the theo OS).
- Windows xuat PDF khong can pacman/MSYS2: tu dong dung weasyprint.exe dong
  goi san (kem Pango) do build_windows.ps1 tai ve dong goi kem.

## 1.0.0 - 07/10/2026

Ban dau tien.

- Tao/sua/xoa note Markdown, luu vao SQLite (FTS5).
- Gan/go tag, tao tag moi.
- Xem truoc song song, chon theme CSS (default, github, dark).
- Dong bo cuon giua editor va preview.
- Tim trong note, thay the trong note.
- Tim toan kho ket hop loc tag.
- Xuat HTML va PDF dung chung mot theme.
- Cai dat qua `make install`, goi phan phoi `marknote-1.0.tar.gz`.